<title>GERMANY: Metro interested in AVA takeover.</title>
<headline>Metro interested in AVA takeover.</headline>
<dateline>COLOGNE, Germany 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>German retail group Metro AG would be interested in a takeover of AVA AG, management board member Klaus Wiegandt said on Tuesday at the company's annual meeting.</p>
<p>Wiegandt said he had no information that Edeka-Zentrale AG was interested in selling the AVA retailer, but if Edeka did, Metro &quot;would certainly be highly interested.&quot;</p>
<p>In April AVA Allgemeine Handelsgesellschaft der Verbraucher AG said first-quarter 1997 group sales rose 12.1 percent to 2.3 billion marks.</p>
<p>German newspapers have reported Edeka was interested in selling AVA.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, +49-228 26097150</p>
</text>
